<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Smith Barney ups Xerox.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Smith Barney ups Xerox.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Smith Barney analyst Peter Enderlin raised Xerox Corp to outperform from neutral, a source at the brokerage said.</p>
<p>-- The analyst was not immediately available to comment.</p>
</text>
